From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] bmalloc: carry the allocator variant a 512 MB armv7 device
 needs

The iOS 6 flavour of bmalloc in bmalloc/ios6, with the build entries that name
it. Its heap reservation pool took the browser process from about 3700 VM
regions to 1100, which is what keeps it under the jetsam limit of this phone.
PAS_BMALLOC is not forced on a 32-bit build, since libpas has no 32-bit
configuration.
